@prefix : <http://example.org/trust-domain/decision-cases#> .
@prefix dm: <http://example.org/trust-domain/decision#> .
@prefix t: <http://example.org/trust-domain/tests#> .

# Answer key for decide_spend.py (insider branch A, the default): the outcome and the exact set of checks
# each proposal is expected to fail. The shapes never read this file.

:P01_TrainerPay          t:expectOutcome dm:Allow ;        t:expectChecks "" .
